<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 lower. Demand light. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA US 1-2 230-260 lbs.  55.50-56.50, few early 57.00, some late</p>
<p>55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3 230-260 lbs.  54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: Weak to 1.00 lower. Top 53.00</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 44.00-47.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 46.00-49.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 49.00-51.00</p>
<p>few over  600 lbs. 51.00-52.00, few 53.00</p>
</text>
